      "text": "盒",
      "reading": "hé"
    }
  ],
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "speaker": "b",
      "text": "小南，明天坐火车，我们买一点儿吃的吧。",
      "reading": "Xiǎonán, míngtiān zuò huǒchē, wǒmen mǎi yīdiǎnr chī de ba."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "a",
      "text": "好！我要面包和饼干。",
      "reading": "Hǎo! Wǒ yào miànbāo hé bǐnggān."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "b",
      "text": "饼干要几盒？",
      "reading": "Bǐnggān yào jǐ hé?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "a",
      "text": "两盒。你要不要方便面？",
      "reading": "Liǎng hé. Nǐ yào bù yào fāngbiànmiàn?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "b",
      "text": "要！冰淇淋呢？要不要？",
      "reading": "Yào! Bīngqílín ne? Yào bù yào?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "a",
      "text": "冰淇淋现在吃吧！",
      "reading": "Bīngqílín xiànzài chī ba!"
    }
  ]
}
